# Firebase service account credential (JSON), used for raw FCM data messages
# that wake incoming-call ringing when the recipient's app is backgrounded or
# killed. Download from Firebase Console → Project Settings → Service Accounts
# → Generate new private key, then paste the ENTIRE file contents as a single-
# line JSON string (no need to escape it further — it's already valid JSON).
# Optional: raw FCM ringing is simply skipped (Expo push still sends) if unset.
FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT=

